# ===========================
# Secrets & Environment (DO NOT PUSH REAL CREDENTIALS)
# ===========================
### CRITICAL FOR MICROSERVICES ###
# Ignore all local, secret, and prod configs.
# (You will commit application.yml as a template, but NEVER the real secrets)
**/application-local.properties
**/application-local.yml
**/application-secret.properties
**/application-secret.yml
**/application-prod.properties
**/application-prod.yml
**/*-secret.yml
**/*-secret.properties

# AWS Credentials (if you accidentally save them locally)
.aws/
aws-keys.txt

